WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.662
The runbook's own code is six PowerShell
scripts in the kit's deploy folder.

2
00:00:04.662 --> 00:00:09.062
The preflight runs eleven checks and
snapshots what the rollback restores.

3
00:00:09.062 --> 00:00:12.509
The smoke test runs seven checks
on the synthetic objects,

4
00:00:12.509 --> 00:00:15.525
and its only write is a
probe that should be refused.

5
00:00:15.525 --> 00:00:17.035
The rollback is planned,

6
00:00:17.035 --> 00:00:20.887
then applied only with its approved
hash, and it never deletes.

7
00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.189
One script builds the smoke-test group

8
00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.850
managed account's plan
for Chapter 6 to apply.

9
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:28.450
The last two record
and check the evidence.

10
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.050
Every script has a fixture mode
that sends nothing anywhere,

11
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:33.620
and there are sixty tests.
